※ pl4g-test: compile=error
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4615 LANG_ARENA_VALUE_GIVEN_BACK

※ Names a tuple is taken apart into were made where the tuple was.

fn both(a: &mut arena) → 〈str, u8〉 in a:
    〈"a" ⧺ "b" in a, 1u8〉
@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    let s: mut arena = ⎕arena
    let x, y := both(&mut s)
    ⎕empty(s)
    if x = "ab" ∧ y = 1u8: 0u6 else: 1u6
